          "text": "Aura episodes"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Two brief episodes of déjà vu, metallic taste, and mild spacing out lasting about 30 seconds in the first 3 months after ICU admission; none in the last approximately 9–10 months."
      }
    },
    {
